Data Dictionary --- ЇжаПоруч (Food Nearby)
1. General Information
Project: ЇжаПоруч --- food delivery service data analytics.
Data warehouse: Google BigQuery.
BigQuery project: master-isotope-509708-m2
Dataset: food_delivery
Dataset location: EU
Main data period: 2024--2025.

This document describes the 9 source tables in the dataset, including
their columns, BigQuery data types, purpose, examples, and
relationships.

Column names and data types reflect the schemas checked during the
BigQuery upload. Examples illustrate the expected value format; some are
representative examples rather than verified values from a specific
source row.
